			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2048002">
									

<p>The lady character is a bit too over the top (seriously, the emphasis on her emerald green eyes reads like fanfic), and there are a number of minor clumsy bits, especially with sentence structure. (I fixed a dialogue tag error I noticed; forgot to comment the edit.)</p>
<p>But on the whole I like it. I'm not sure I followed all of what happened in the story besides the really basic stuff, but certain moments are quite memorable (&quot;How would you like to work with a fully operational black hole generator?&quot; &#8212; even though I don't care all that much for the seduction angle, it's pretty effective here). +1</p>

